    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Jeremy Murphy & Associates are delighted to bring to the market this charming three-bedroom mid-terraced property, ideally situated in the popular and convenient area of Eagle Valley.\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys an excellent location just off Sarsfield Road, providing easy access to Cork’s wider road network and the Link Road system. This makes commuting to Cork City Centre, Cork Airport and surrounding employment centers particularly convenient.\r\n\r\nA major benefit of this home is its proximity to a wide range of amenities. Wilton Shopping Centre is close by, offering a variety of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday services, while Cork University Hospital is also within easy reach.\r\n\r\nViewing is Highly Advised to Fully Appreciate!\r\n\r\nAccommodation consists of Entrance Hallway, Living Room, Kitchen, Dining Room, WC. Upstairs there are Three Bedrooms and a Family Bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "FRONT OF PROPERTY\r\nTo the front of the property there is off street parking.\r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALLWAY          \t1.80m x 4.35m\r\nThe entrance hallway comprises of timber effect laminate flooring, one alarm, one centre light, one radiator and space for storage under the stairs.\r\n\r\nLIVING ROOM \t\t           3.32m x 4.38m\r\nThis bright and spacious living room has timber effect laminate flooring, one centre light, one radiator and one window overlooking the front of the property. The living room also has a feature gas fireplace and double doors that lead into the dining room.\r\n\r\nDINING ROOM                          2.66m x 3.76m\r\nThe dining area comprises of timber effect laminate flooring, one centre light, one radiator and sliding glass doors that lead out to the rear. The dining room can comfortably facilitate a dining table and six to eight chairs.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN\t \t                      5.76m x 2.58m\r\nThis kitchen benefits from tiled effect lino flooring, one window overlooking the rear, one radiator, one door leading out to the rear and two centre lights. The newly fitted kitchen also benefits from a range of fitted kitchen units. The kitchen incorporates a stainless-steel sink with a draining board, an integrated fridge/freezer, dishwasher and plumbing for a washing machine. There is a double oven with a gas four ring hob and an extractor fan located above. \r\n\r\nGUEST WC \t\t\t1.42m x 0.81m\r\nThere is lino flooring, one wash hand basin and a wc. The guest wc also incorporates one centre light and one extractor fan.\r\n\r\nSTAIRS & LANDING               2.04m x 2.85m\r\nThe stairs and landing are fully carpeted. Via the landing there is one centre light, access to the hot-press and attic via stira stairs.\r\n\r\nMASTER BEDROOM              2.75m x 4.41m\r\nThis double bedroom features solid timber fitted flooring, one centre light, one radiator and one window overlooking the front of the property. This bedroom also has built in wardrobe units.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2 \t                    3.16m x 3.46m\r\nThis double bedroom features carpet fitted flooring, one centre light, one radiator and one window overlooking the rear of the property. This bedroom also has built in wardrobe units.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3\t                    2.47m x 2.88m\r\nThis bedroom features carpet fitted flooring, one centre light, one radiator and one window overlooking the front of the property. This bedroom also has built in wardrobe units.\r\n\r\nMAIN BATHROOM \t         2.03m x 2.02m\r\nThe main bathroom features a three-piece suite comprising a bath with an electric shower attachment, wash hand basin, and WC. There is one centre light, lino flooring, one frosted window overlooking the rear.\r\n\r\nREAR OF PROPERTY\r\nThe rear of the property has been well maintained and enjoys excellent sunlight from the West Facing aspect. A patio area provides ample space for outdoor furniture, making it ideal for al fresco dining and entertaining. The garden is laid to lawn with a timber shed to the rear. The outdoor area creates a perfect setting for relaxing during the summer months."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Double Glazed Windows\r\nIdeal Family Home or First Time Purchaser\r\nCentral Location\r\nOn UCC bus route\r\nClose Proximity to Wilton Shopping Centre\r\nClose To All Amenities \r\nEasy access to Cork University Hospital and Link Roads\r\nGas Fired Central Heating with Built in Climote App \r\nFully Alarmed\r\nViewing is Highly Advised!\r\nYear of Construction: 1996\r\nBER No: C\r\nBuilding Energy Rating: 119836484\r\nOverall Floor Area: 89.8 (m2)\r\nClose to all essential amenities, including CUH, Cork City Centre, and the train station, with the 214 bus route conveniently serving these stops."
      },
